bb-plugin-web-search
====================

No third-party code is included. The plugin talks to services the operator
runs or pays for:

- SearXNG (AGPL-3.0) — spoken to over its HTTP JSON API, not linked or bundled.
- Keenable — the local CLI, invoked as a subprocess (`search`, `fetch`).
- Brave Search API and Serper — HTTP APIs, keys supplied by the operator.

The `yaml` npm package (ISC) parses Keenable's output.

Everything in this repository is MIT, original work by prismatic7.
